{"scenario":"permission-then-exit","description":"Two permission requests; once the client answers the second (allow-once), a third; once it answers that one too, the agent exits with the first still pending","on_stdin_close":"exit"}
{"expect":{"method":"initialize","as":"init","params":{"protocolVersion":1}}}
